        "contrib"
      ],
      "position": 2
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "CloudNativePG 给出从 Crunchy PGO 迁移的配方",
      "summary": "Snowflake 收购 Crunchy Data 后，Crunchy PGO v6 上的集群要考虑退路。Gabriele Bartolini 给了两条路：离线那条用 CloudNativePG 内置的 pg_dump 导入，停机随数据量增长；在线那条用逻辑复制持续同步，由 Publication 与 Subscription 两个 CRD 描述，切换时排空队列，停机以秒计。序列仍要手工同步，原生支持要等 PostgreSQL 19。",
      "url": "https://www.gabrielebartolini.it/articles/2026/05/cnpg-recipe-24-migrating-from-crunchy-pgo-to-postgresql-18-with-cloudnativepg/",
